  "statement": {
    "binders": [
      "x is the spatial coordinate, with the interface placed at x = 0; t is time, with initial data specified at t = 0 [printed p. 5, equation (1.11); printed p. 8, selected sentence].",
      "q is the unknown state and q_l, q_r are its constant left and right initial states. Their state space and number of components are not specified in the cited definition [printed p. 5, Section 1.2.1, equation (1.11)].",
