      "In the selected extension, the medium also has a discontinuity at x = 0 [printed p. 8, Section 1.4, selected sentence]."
    ],
    "conclusions": [
      "The Riemann-problem setup extends to accommodate a discontinuity in the medium at x = 0 together with a discontinuity in the initial data at that interface [printed p. 8, Section 1.4, selected sentence; initial-data convention from printed p. 5, equation (1.11)]."
    ],
    "definitions_and_conventions": [
      "A Riemann problem consists of the hyperbolic equation together with the specified special initial data [printed p. 5, Section 1.2.1, opening paragraph].",
