          "The selected extension concerns both the medium and the initial state, with the medium interface explicitly placed at x = 0 [printed p. 8, selected sentence].",
          "The inherited initial-data definition places the left/right state split at x = 0 [printed p. 5, equation (1.11)]."
        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "Nature and scope of the assertion",
        "details": [
